\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \cb3 \strokec4 Chemistry 1015 5 minutes 15 seconds\cb1 \
\cb3 is if you take a bunch of sample means from the same distribution, just different random samples of the same size, and you take their mean. So in other words, the mean of those sample means,\cb1 \
