\cf5 \strokec5 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \cb3 \strokec4 Chemistry 1015 5 minutes 36 seconds\cb1 \
\cb3 That is the, that is why we're allowed to say it's an unbiased estimator. So this thing is mean of sample means.\cb1 \
