\cf5 \strokec5 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \cb3 \strokec4 Chemistry 1015 5 minutes 54 seconds\cb1 \
\cb3 OK, so what that says is it, the sample mean X-bar.\cb1 \
