\cf5 \strokec5 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \cb3 \strokec4 Chemistry 1015 6 minutes 2 seconds\cb1 \
\cb3 I'm not saying it's going to be perfect every time in estimating mu. That's not what unbiased estimator means. But if you look at the average inclination or the average tendency, the centre of that distribution, the middle of it will estimate mu very, very well.\cb1 \
